Package: autoscene-ui
Version: 1.1.2
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: AutoScene Team
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-pyqt5, python3-yaml, python3-numpy
Description: AutoScene ROS1 experiment manager desktop UI
 PyQt5 desktop frontend for configuring and monitoring AutoScene experiments.
 It connects to ROS1 through rosbridge and supports dataset visualization,
 platform binding, virtual BV placement, experiment control and live metrics.
 The websocket client is bundled for reliable offline installation.
